{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04AX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0004": "$i$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0006": "$i \\to j$", "MATH_0007": "$j$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{I}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cofinal-in-filtered}\n", "suffix": "\n\\end{lemma}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4c97762cda7e55dd802231ccf230c9f776bf1f582a0ed710267965ae08f7885b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f8dc9e624b6a1724fc71b9adb7faa1556a5151abbcce405d389318f857d83a22", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. Let <MATH_0002> be a full subcategory.\nAssume that <MATH_0003> is filtered. Assume also that for any object\n<MATH_0004> of <MATH_0005>, there exists a morphism <MATH_0006>\nto some object <MATH_0007> of <MATH_0008>. Then <MATH_0009>\nis filtered and cofinal in <MATH_0010>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4c06aa4092a055482af4a9c2fa4fe24bf711905257ba07fb1bbacac28d08b7aa", "unit_id": "tag:0BUC:statement"}
